Cell["\<\
Now, you do the evolution equation for the extrinsic curvature (it should be \
pretty much equivalent to the metric equation). I suggest you call the \
resulting equations \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]ceqspher\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
and \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]deqspher\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8460043728582563`*^9, 
  3.846004459730946*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"be236686-183b-4b08-afff-\
fd2e787c8656"],

